      "message": "Hi please take a look at this, thanks.\n\nFor floss: we need to send confirmation when we are not bonding, so remove the state bonding check from floss stack.\n\nFor Libbluetooth: we are failed to upgrade the security because we use BTM_SEC_LE_AUTHENTICATED flag even when we are not pair in mitm in le-security.\nThis flag should only be set if we are pair in mitn.",
